{
  "slug": "memoriant-patent-skills",
  "name": "Memoriant Patent Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AI-powered patent workflow for Claude Code. 6 skills + 4 specialized agents that cover the full patent lifecycle: prior art search (USPTO 7-step methodology across PatentsView and USPTO databases), patentability analysis (35 USC 101, 102, 103, 112), application drafting (provisional, non-provisional, PCT formats), USPTO compliance review, patent diagram generation, and end-to-end pipeline orchestration. Model-agnostic — works with Claude, Ollama, vLLM, or any OpenAI-compatible endpoint. No servers required.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills** and **4 agents**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `patent-config` (v1.0.0 — Configure the Memoriant Patent Platform — LLM provider, search providers, API keys, and connection mode (API-connected…), `patent-diagrams` (v1.0.0 — Generate patent-specific diagrams using visual-explainer as rendering engine), `patent-draft` (v1.0.0 — Generate patent applications in USPTO provisional, non-provisional, or PCT format from an invention description and prior…), `patent-pipeline` (v1.0.0 — Run the full patent workflow from invention idea to filing-ready draft), `patent-review` (v1.0.0 — AI-assisted review of patent applications against all major USPTO rejection types including 101, 102, 103, 112(a),…), `patent-search` (v1.0.0 — Search US patents for prior art using the USPTO 7-step methodology)\n- **Agents** (4): `patent-drafter`, `patent-illustrator`, `patent-reviewer`, `prior-art-searcher`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install memoriant-patent-skills@claude-community` from `NathanMaine/memoriant-patent-skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 6,
    "agent": 4
  },
